Package: piewifi
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: base-files (>= 8), blueberry-pie-os-kernel (>= 12377.121.6+pie8), kext-tools (>= 2),
 openssl (>= 3.5.9), pie-firmware-brcm (>= 20261019+ds1-1), pie-firmware-brcm (<< 20261019+ds2~)
Description: WiFi for the CYW43455 on SDIO
 PIE80211Family.kext is OpenBSD's net80211 for a station, with open
 networks and WPA2-PSK with CCMP. PIEbwfm.kext is OpenBSD's bwfm driver
 for the CYW43455 of the Raspberry Pi 4 and 500. kextd loads the driver when
 the chip's SDIO function appears, and PIE80211Family with it.
